  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>經典主機版教學世界合集</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我建立了一個合集，彙整了<strong>經典主機版</strong>中的所有教學世界。<a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fLegacy_Console_Edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">經典主機版</a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。這裡包含了從 TU1 到 TU69 的所有教學世界，並且也包含了迷你遊戲大廳：</span></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu1\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU1</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu3\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU3</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu5\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU5</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu7\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU7</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU9</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu12\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU12</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu14\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU14</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu19\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU19</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu31\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU31</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu46\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU46</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu69\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU69</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2016-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2016 迷你遊戲大廳</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2017-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2017 迷你遊戲大廳</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些教學世界可以更新至 Java 版的最新版本，並且還有可以更新至最新版本的 Bedrock 版。</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">致謝：</strong></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">由 Minecraft 建築師轉換並更新</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><em>這些世界非常古老，並且已被移植到其他版本，因此可能包含錯誤且不穩定。</em></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
